{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1298398-rules-query-specializations","id":1298398,"title":"Rules Query; Specializations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-21T14:29:57-07:00","id":1298398,"title":"Rules Query; Specializations","content":"This may have been a weird house rule or thing I got confused with another setting.<br /> <br /> I remember it being possible to purchase/buy additional specializations. I think there was a limit to the number you could have for each skill though.<br /> <br /> Am I wrong? Confused about another system?<br /> <br /> I'm just trying to check on stuff and not lose my mind at the same time. Please. Thanks. All hail Hypno Toad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24856-eizenfaust","name":"eizenfaust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T14:51:51-07:00","id":1298400,"title":"","content":"In baseline WtA, there's no way to obtain more than one Specialty per Attribute/Ability.<br /> <br /> From official sources:<br /> <br /> 1) Your character can invest in a &quot;secondary&quot; Ability, in the 20th books referred to as Hobby Talents, Professional Skills, and Expert Knowledges.<br /> <br /> 2) In the Revised Dark Ages rules (including DA Werewolf) Ability Specialties worked differently than they do in the other iterations of the game, and could be purchased multiple times.<br /> <br /> 3) The Mage games have offered more optional rules for this. Revised allowing a second Specialty at cost. M20 having the Well Skilled Craftsman rule that allows multiple specialties to be obtained for some Abilities.<br /> <br /> There's also been a large number of house rules over the years.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}